# --- Globalne zvezdice za sve podprojekte ---

# --- Node.js (gRPC Service) ---
**/node_modules/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/package-lock.json
**/.pnp*
**/.cache/

# --- Python (FastAPI Services) ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.env
**/.venv
**/venv/
**/ENV/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/

# --- Docker & Volumes (Baze podataka) ---
**/.docker/
**/postgres_data/
**/mongodb_data/
**/cassandra_data/
**/redis_data/
**/qdrant_storage/

# --- Databases & OS ---
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini

# --- IDEs & Tools ---
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# --- Load Testing (k6) & Teški podaci ---
**/summary.json
**/*.log
**/intel_data.json
**/data.txt.gz
